MAJOR COCAINE SEIZURE.

@USCG personnel intercepted a smuggling vessel off the coast of Puerto Rico carrying OVER 7,000 POUNDS of cocaine. The five smugglers on board were ARRESTED.

Thank you to these Coast Guard heroes for protecting our homeland and eliminating this threat.

